flowchart TB
  accTitle: Findings and optional disclosure
  accDescr: Local review is independent of providers. User-authorized selected inputs may go directly to a provider or through premium processing. Derived findings return to local storage. Agent feedback is deferred.
  Evidence[("💾 Private local evidence")]
  Evidence --> Local["Offline timeline / search / corrections<br/>target useful baseline"]
  Evidence --> Select["Select evidence and purpose<br/>exclude unrelated private context"]
  Select --> Grant{"🔐 Authorized recipient<br/>and data scope?"}
  Grant -->|"no"| Local
  Grant -->|"yes"| Route{"Execution route"}
  Route -->|"local inference candidate"| DeviceModel["On-device model / memory<br/>hardware feasibility open"]
  Route -->|"default hosted"| Direct["Device → chosen provider"]
  Route -->|"premium + explicit disclosure"| Backend["Wellspent processor<br/>selected plaintext only"]
  Backend --> Hosted["Chosen AI / memory service"]
  Direct --> Hosted
  DeviceModel --> Receipt["Input references + receipt<br/>output version + uncertainty"]
  Hosted --> Receipt
  Receipt --> Findings["👤 Findings for the user<br/>inspect and correct"]
  Findings --> Evidence
  Deferred["Agent memory injection / actions<br/>deferred; no automatic feedback"]
  classDef proposed fill:#FFF0D1,stroke:#8D5D11,stroke-width:2px,color:#493005
  classDef private fill:#DCECFB,stroke:#285B85,stroke-width:2px,color:#173B58
  classDef later fill:#EEEEEE,stroke:#666666,stroke-width:2px,color:#303030
  class Select,Grant,Route,DeviceModel,Direct,Backend,Hosted,Receipt,Findings proposed
  class Evidence,Local private
  class Deferred later
